RmlUi upstream commit 3707ab5382262208e5b215c9f7c1f9e25c20fab6, backported
unchanged to the pinned 58c751531f4c1a1eb2dc56f409b8e8a323a0c9ad.

  Avoid out-of-bounds in widget text input before formatting, see #958
  (Michael Ragazzon, 2026-07-11; MIT, as RmlUi)

A text input whose font does not resolve is never formatted, so its line list
stayed empty and a click into it read before the start of the list. Upstream
starts the list with one empty line. Retire this file when the pin moves past
3707ab53.

